Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='lockedwords', at=datetime(2026, 10, 13, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title="A conversation's words are sealed per slot under keys of their own, scrubbed once when written", body="Since words stage 2 the conversations' WORDS ARE LOCKED (`secretary::line_event`): one store, `secretary-lines/`, keyed by conversation, a line's shape in the clear and each slot of its words (a turn, a model's prose, each call's arguments) through the redaction door ONCE, when it is written (`line_event::seal`), and sealed under a key of its own in `secretary-lines-keys/`, box-local, vaulted, never pushed. Erasing is an `Erased` line naming keys and the sweep destroying them (monotone, no hold); a forget erases the copies its remembering provably made (`secretary::caused`) and offers the rest on a card. The plain store it was carried from is deleted with its reader (words stage 4).", rationale='Words stage 2 shipped in 1.11.0, 2026-10-13; stage 4 deleted the plain store and its reader.', supersedes=()))